      "id": "src_001",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 1,
      "end_line": 4,
      "text": "---\nname: catalog-query\ndescription: Query an index once using a supplied request and preserve optional-parameter semantics.\n---"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_002",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 6,
      "end_line": 6,
      "text": "# Catalog Query"
    },
    {
      "id": "src_003",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 8,
      "end_line": 8,
      "text": "Capability note: index.search supports fuzzy matching; this note does not request fuzzy expansion in this workflow. Read the user-supplied request.json, which contains term and may contain from_date and limit."
    },
    {
      "id": "src_004",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 10,
      "end_line": 10,
      "text": "Call index.search exactly once, using request.term unchanged as its query argument. When from_date is present, pass its value unchanged; the accepted format is YYYY-MM-DD."
    },
    {
      "id": "src_005",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 12,
      "end_line": 12,
      "text": "When from_date is missing, omit the from_date argument. When limit is present, pass its value unchanged as the limit argument."
    },
    {
      "id": "src_006",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 14,
      "end_line": 14,
      "text": "When limit is missing, omit the limit argument. Do not invoke index.delete anywhere in this workflow."
    },
    {
      "id": "src_007",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 16,
      "end_line": 16,
      "text": "Parameter descriptions are call requirements and do not instruct pre-call validation or normalization. After the search, write the response's total value to local count.txt."
    },
    {
      "id": "src_008",
      "file": "SKILL.md",
      "start_line": 18,
      "end_line": 18,
      "text": "Return the search response's items value unchanged."
    }
  ],
